// Under a minute, for a short: "The context wall". Claude is deep in a task, its terminal
// full of work, when its context fills up. Claude Code compacts the conversation (the screen
// clears to its "Conversation compacted" line), Pixel shows its COMPACTED card and then looks
// lost for a moment (where was I?); Claude picks up where it left off, adds the tax, the tests
